cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived software release."
title: "Probabilistic day-ahead electricity-price forecasting in Great Britain: modelling and evaluation code"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Agrawal
    given-names: Anirudh
    affiliation: "UCL Energy Institute, University College London"
abstract: >-
  Modelling and evaluation code for probabilistic forecasts of hourly EPEX
  SPOT Great Britain day-ahead electricity prices. The release implements the
  historical and linear benchmarks, quantile regression forest,
  Encoder-Decoder LSTM, conformal calibration, multi-window LEAR-QRA, and
  two- and three-model Quantile Regression Averaging combinations.
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - probabilistic forecasting
  - electricity price forecasting
  - quantile regression averaging
  - conformal prediction
  - day-ahead electricity market
  - machine learning
